{"id": "ru-3a049c5b9532.ru", "jokeId": "ru-3a049c5b9532", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source wording kept, the wife's long line split in three. Four scenes: bedroom (both asleep, he sits up at the bell and walks to the door) → hallway (the tipsy man with a red nose and a bottle on the threshold) → bedroom (he lies down, she sits up and scolds, he gets up) → the night courtyard: he comes out of the entrance into the dark, the drunk answers from the darkness, and only on the punchline walks into the lamp light and sits on the swing, so the pun lands on the last word.", "title": "Толкнуть", "location": "spalnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Три часа ночи. Муж с женой спят.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Вдруг звонок в дверь.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Муж, матерясь, идет открывать.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На пороге стоит мужик, очевидно поддатый:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Друг, пойдем со мной, тут рядом, поможешь меня толкануть.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ты, мужик, охренел, что ли? Три часа ночи. Иди кого-нибудь другого проси.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Муж ложится опять в постель.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Жена спрашивает, кто приходил.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Да, какой-то козел застрял, просил его толкнуть. Я его послал.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Ты просто зверюга какой-то.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Помнишь, как у нас мотор заглох, да под дождем, и нас какой-то парень целый час толкал?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Ты что, человека выручить не можешь?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Муж, опять матерясь, вылезает из постели, одевается.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Выходит во двор в полной темноте. Кричит:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Мужик! Ты где?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Из темноты:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Здесь я! Иди сюда!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "offscreen": true}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Да где здесь?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Ну здесь, на качелях!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "spalnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "bed-1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "bed-2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "sleep"}, {"type": "act", "who": "zhena", "act": "sleep"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "sit"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "door"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "place": "front-door", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "muzhik-ryzhy": "drunk"}, "looks": {"muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["red-nose"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "door"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "act": "wave"}, 