{"id": "ru-3a049c5b9532.en", "jokeId": "ru-3a049c5b9532", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 'give me a push' covers both a stalled car and a swing, as the adapt note says, so the pun survives. Same staging as ru: bedroom → hallway with the tipsy man on the threshold → bedroom → the night courtyard, where the drunk is a voice from the dark and appears on the swing only with the punchline.", "title": "The Push", "location": "spalnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Three in the morning. A husband and wife are asleep.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Suddenly the doorbell rings.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The husband, swearing, goes to open the door.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "On the doorstep stands a man, obviously tipsy:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Buddy, come with me, it's right nearby, you can give me a push.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Man, are you out of your mind? It's three in the morning. Go ask somebody else.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The husband gets back into bed.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "His wife asks who it was.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Oh, some jerk got stuck and asked me to give him a push. I told him to get lost.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "You're just some kind of beast.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Remember when our engine died, in the pouring rain, and some young guy pushed us for a whole hour?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Can't you help a person out?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The husband, swearing again, crawls out of bed and gets dressed.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He goes out into the yard in pitch darkness. He shouts:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Hey, man! Where are you?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Out of the darkness:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Here I am! Over here!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "offscreen": true}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Where's here?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Right here, on the swings!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "spalnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "bed-1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "bed-2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "sleep"}, {"type": "act", "who": "zhena", "act": "sleep"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "sit"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "door"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "place": "front-door", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "muzhik-ryzhy": "drunk"}, "looks": {"muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["red-nose"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "door"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "act": "wave"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}, {"location": "spalnya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "door"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "bed-2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "zhena", "act": "sleep"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "bed-1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "lie"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "act", "who": "zhena", "act": "sit"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "wave"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "act", "who": "zhena", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "act", "who": "zhena", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "act", "who": "zhena", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "stand"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "door"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}]}, {"location": "ulitsa", "place": "yard-night", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "muzhik-ryzhy": "drunk"}, "looks": {"muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["red-nose"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "entrance"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "wave"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "turn"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l17"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "scratch-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l18"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "from": "off-right", "to": "swing"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "facepalm"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l19"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-3a049c5b9532.de", "jokeId": "ru-3a049c5b9532", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 'anschubsen' covers both the stalled car and the swing (adapt note), the wife's memory of the car uses 'angeschoben'. Same staging as ru: bedroom → hallway → bedroom → the night courtyard, where the drunk is a voice from the dark and appears on the swing only with the punchline.", "title": "Anschubsen", "location": "spalnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Drei Uhr nachts. Mann und Frau schlafen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Plötzlich klingelt es an der Tür.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Mann geht fluchend aufmachen.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Vor der Tür steht ein Kerl, offensichtlich angetrunken:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Freund, komm mit, ist gleich hier um die Ecke, du musst mich anschubsen.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Sag mal, Mann, spinnst du? Es ist drei Uhr nachts. Frag jemand anderen.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Mann legt sich wieder ins Bett.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Die Frau fragt, wer da war.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ach, irgendein Trottel hängt fest und wollte, dass ich ihn anschubse. Ich hab ihn zum Teufel geschickt.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Du bist echt ein Unmensch.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Weißt du noch, wie uns der Motor abgesoffen ist, mitten im Regen, und irgendein junger Kerl uns eine ganze Stunde angeschoben hat?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Kannst du einem Menschen nicht mal aushelfen?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Mann kriecht, wieder fluchend, aus dem Bett und zieht sich an.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Er geht hinaus in den Hof, stockdunkel. Er ruft:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Hey, Mann! Wo bist du?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Aus der Dunkelheit:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Hier bin ich! Komm her!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "offscreen": true}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Wo ist denn hier?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Na hier, auf der Schaukel!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "spalnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "bed-1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "bed-2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "sleep"}, {"type": "act", "who": "zhena", "act": "sleep"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "sit"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "door"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "place": "front-door", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "muzhik-ryzhy": "drunk"}, "looks": {"muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["red-nose"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "door"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", 